note.p:
Source: Ford Library, National Security Adviser, Kissinger Reports on USSR,
                    China, and Middle East Discussions, 1974–1976, Box 1, USSR Memcons and Reports, July 10–11, 1975—Kissinger/Gromyko Meetings in Geneva (1). Top Secret; Sensitive;
                    Exclusively Eyes Only. The meeting was held at the Soviet Mission.
